{"1496970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Masters of Mayhem", "steam_appid": 1496970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Masters of Mayhem is a free-to-play social deduction game with roguelike twists for 4–15 players. Work together to restore abandoned facilities and contain terrifying monsters — unless you're an impostor, in which case… have fun unleashing mayhem!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ADOPT THE ROLE OF INNOCENT OR IMPOSTOR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496970/extras/f579f39e5f6b63fa56b74f8c8c7717e7.poster.avif?t=1787266581\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496970/extras/f579f39e5f6b63fa56b74f8c8c7717e7.webm?t=1787266581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496970/extras/f579f39e5f6b63fa56b74f8c8c7717e7.mp4?t=1787266581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each game, you'll be secretly assigned the role of Innocent or Impostor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only Impostors know who the other Impostors are!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make socially strategic decisions - identify Impostors, or lie through your teeth!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>COMPLETE TASKS OR TAKE OUT INNOCENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496970/extras/344259cc445aabb23aae7ac421a77013.poster.avif?t=1787266581\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496970/extras/344259cc445aabb23aae7ac421a77013.webm?t=1787266581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496970/extras/344259cc445aabb23aae7ac421a77013.mp4?t=1787266581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an Innocent, complete tricky and tactile tasks while being on the look out for suspicious behavior.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an Impostor,  take out Innocents while remaining undetected!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>VOTE OUT IMPOSTORS OR FRAME INNOCENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496970/extras/8c789c822f46ef2daa8fcf8d819e652d.poster.avif?t=1787266581\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496970/extras/8c789c822f46ef2daa8fcf8d819e652d.webm?t=1787266581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496970/extras/8c789c822f46ef2daa8fcf8d819e652d.mp4?t=1787266581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plead your case in the voting room. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frame others, share evidence, spread speculations and theories!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out the truth as voted out Impostors fall into the abyss - but beware, every Imposter can still influence the game in the afterlife!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SELECT YOUR PERKS PER MATCH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496970/extras/68c9af954a99b27b304593ab9ecc51e8.poster.avif?t=1787266581\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496970/extras/68c9af954a99b27b304593ab9ecc51e8.webm?t=1787266581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496970/extras/68c9af954a99b27b304593ab9ecc51e8.mp4?t=1787266581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain perk rewards every match for taking part in activities or voting correctly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disguise yourself as a box, take on the form of another player, blast other players and much much more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match, with up to 3 active perks allowed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique perks for Innocents and Imposters.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MASTER THE MAYHEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496970/extras/e7c3f8995a08d634c4b610a959803767.poster.avif?t=1787266581\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496970/extras/e7c3f8995a08d634c4b610a959803767.webm?t=1787266581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496970/extras/e7c3f8995a08d634c4b610a959803767.mp4?t=1787266581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete tasks <i>(or eliminate innocents)</i> before it's too late!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the number of innocents and impostors becomes equal, a monster is unleashed, eating everyone in sight!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sow mayhem! Our game is stacked with environmental hazards and tools designed to maximize the mayhem.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>--------------------------------------------------------------------</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FEATURE SUMMARY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social deduction at its best - read the room, deceive your friends, uncover hidden agendas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike perks every run - mix and match abilities to create your own playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4–15 players - host public and private lobbies, or use our matchmaking queue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat and text chat supported</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 maps to explore - the frozen Arctic and ancient Temple, each hiding a monster the Impostors are plotting to unleash.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant characters with unique lore, animations, and personality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More game modes, characters, and content on the way!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FROM THE MAKERS OF…</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Masters of Mayhem is built by <strong>Super Studios</strong>, led by industry veteran <strong>Rick Ellis (Valve, Team Fortress, Half-Life 2)</strong>. Join our Discord to playtest, give feedback, and help shape the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496970/extras/2dbe03336296239b5a829064971ed124.avif?t=1787266581\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496970/extras_big/2dbe03336296239b5a829064971ed124.webp?t=1787266581 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "abo