\"text-align: center\"><strong>--------------------------------------------------------------------</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FEATURE SUMMARY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social deduction at its best - read the room, deceive your friends, uncover hidden agendas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike perks every run - mix and match abilities to create your own playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4–15 players - host public and private lobbies, or use our matchmaking queue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat and text chat supported</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 maps to explore - the frozen Arctic and ancient Temple, each hiding a monster the Impostors are plotting to unleash.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant characters with unique lore, animations, and personality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More game modes, characters, and content on the way!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FROM THE MAKERS OF…</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Masters of Mayhem is built by <strong>Super Studios</strong>, led by industry veteran <strong>Rick Ellis (Valve, Team Fortress, Half-Life 2)</strong>. Join our Discord to playtest, give feedback, and help shape the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496970/extras/2dbe03336296239b5a829064971ed124.avif?t=1787266581\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496970/extras_big/2dbe03336296239b5a829064971ed124.webp?t=1787266581 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A vibrant co-op social deduction adventure with roguelike twists, wild abilities, monsters, and nonstop mayhem.", "supported_languages":